Shared libraries can have unresolved symbols. You can create them with
a flag -expect_unresolved "*" (or similar like this) so you don't get
warnings when creating shared libraries. You need just to resolve all
the symbols when you create your image. Read the OSF/1 programmer's
guide. There is a hole chapter about shared libraries.

Cheers

Juerg




