The program not registered message is coming from the portmapper. It
means that there is not a mountd (I think that's the one for NFS mounts)
service "registered" with the portmapper. Ie. you're not running any
nfsds.

Try running nfssetup on the alpha and make sure you say yes when it asks
you if you want to export and NFS filesystems...

