Subject: SUMMARY: IP delivers packets only every milli-second?
Date: 1995/08/21
Message-ID: <41a7v8$kpj@sheckley.cnam.fr>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 108584099
distribution: world
references: <4078vd$1sr@sheckley.cnam.fr>
