>1:14.510279 DEC > Sun: . ack 2198817 win 0 (id 11648)
>
> and after 121ms silence, the Sun tries its luck with
> some out-of-window data...

Which is illegal.  You are only allowed to send 1 byte of data into a
closed window (to probe the window to see if it has opened).

>1:14.631303 Sun > DEC: P 2198817:2199420(603) ack 227 win 33580 (DF) (id 16111)
>1:14.632279 Sun > DEC: P 2199420:2200277(857) ack 227 win 33580 (DF) (id 16112)
