>
>1:14.633255 DEC > Sun: . ack 2200277 win 64076 (id 11649)
>1:14.633255 DEC > Sun: . ack 2200277 win 64076 (id 11650)

Why is DEC sending these duplicate segments (the two above)?  They're
identical except for the IP ID field.  Also notice that between times
1:14.510279 and 1:14.633255 DEC opened its window by 64076 bytes.
That's a lot of data read by the process on DEC.

