Well your math is correct, but my equation is in-correct while my
answer is correct.  Basically, it's really:

	8 x (SCSI Bus num - 1) + DevID
	8 x (4 - 1) + 5 = 29

Thanks for catching my goof.

Joseph> Worse yet, as I recollect, the sh dev display he reproduces
Joseph> shows _all_ the buses available, even if there's no controller
Joseph> in them (at least it does for the DEC 4000's), so what shows
Joseph> up as MKD500 in sh dev could be, say, MKC500 or MKB500, for
